  "captions": [
    {
      "start": 6.861,
      "end": 11.061,
      "en": "Life is a chain of choices.",
      "ja": "人生は選択の連鎖です。"
    },
    {
      "start": 12.782,
      "end": 25.564,
      "en": "From the small choice of what to eat in the morning, to the grave decision of what profession to follow or whom to live with.",
      "ja": "朝何を食べるかという小さな選択から、どの profession に就くか、誰と暮らすかという重大な decision まで。"
    },
    {
      "start": 26.684,
      "end": 31.565,
      "en": "We cannot always make the correct choice.",
      "ja": "私たちは常に correct な選択をできるとは限りません。"
    },
    {
      "start": 33.105,
      "end": 36.825,
      "en": "We make mistakes, and we feel regret.",
      "ja": "私たちは間違いを犯し、regret を感じます。"
    },
    {
      "start": 37.866,
      "end": 43.886,
      "en": "But failure is often what brings the insight for the next step.",
      "ja": "しかし多くの場合、failure は次の一歩への insight をもたらします。"
    },
    {
      "start": 44.427,
      "end": 48.607,
      "en": "Fear often stops us.",
      "ja": "Fear はしばしば、私たちの歩みを止めます。"
    },
    {
      "start": 48.907,
      "end": 51.548,
      "en": "What if I fail?",
      "ja": "失敗したらどうなりますか？"
    },
    {
      "start": 52.168,
      "end": 54.808,
      "en": "What if they laugh?",
      "ja": "彼らが笑ったらどうなるでしょうか？"
    },
    {
      "start": 55.951,
      "end": 61.269,
      "en": "To overcome that fear and take a step forward is courage.",
      "ja": "その Fear を乗り越えて一歩 forward に踏み出すのが courage です。"
    },
    {
      "start": 61.589,
      "end": 64.85,
      "en": "There is a word called fate.",
      "ja": "fate という言葉があります。"
    },
    {
      "start": 65.57,
      "end": 70.37,
      "en": "But fate is not something determined in advance.",
      "ja": "しかし fate は、あらかじめ determined されたものではありません。"
    },
    {
      "start": 71.151,
      "end": 77.231,
      "en": "Through each daily decision, we determine our own path.",
      "ja": "日々の decision を通じて、私たちは自分の道を determine します。"
    },
    {
      "start": 78.594,
      "end": 90.133,
      "en": "A philosopher once said, Life can only be lived forward, but it can only be understood backward.",
      "ja": "かつてある philosopher は、人生は forward にしか生きられず、backward にしか理解できないと言いました。"
    },
    {
      "start": 91.654,
      "end": 95.734,
      "en": "That may be precisely true.",
      "ja": "それは precisely その通りかもしれません。"
    },
    {
      "start": 96.314,
      "end": 103.015,
      "en": "What matters is to keep walking the road we have chosen.",
      "ja": "大切なのは、自分が選んだ道を歩き続けることです。"
    },
    {
      "start": 107.076,
      "end": 112.697,
      "en": "Occasionally we stop, look back, and then walk on.",
